    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "text": "17.3.1 MIDI Port Inputs and Outputs",
      "heading_context": [
        {
          "level": 1,
          "text": "17. Routing and I/O",
          "html_line": 280,
          "anchor": "routing-and-io",
          "section": "17"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "17.3 External MIDI In/Out",
          "html_line": 314,
          "anchor": "external-midi-inout",
          "section": "17.3"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "17.3.1 MIDI Port Inputs and Outputs",
          "html_line": 314,
          "anchor": "midi-port-inputs-and-outputs",
          "section": "17.3.1"
        }
      ],
      "html_line": 314,
      "anchor": "midi-port-inputs-and-outputs",
      "section": "17.3.1",
      "locator": "routing:B027"
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "You can configure which MIDI ports are made available to Live using the Inputs and Outputs options in the MIDI section of the Link, Tempo & MIDI Settings. All available input and output ports are listed here. You can use any number of MIDI ports for track input and output; the mixer’s In/Out choosers allow them to be addressed individually.",
      "heading_context": [
        {
          "level": 1,
          "text": "17. Routing and I/O",
          "html_line": 280,
          "anchor": "routing-and-io",
          "section": "17"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "17.3 External MIDI In/Out",
          "html_line": 314,
          "anchor": "external-midi-inout",
          "section": "17.3"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "17.3.1 MIDI Port Inputs and Outputs",
          "html_line": 314,
          "anchor": "midi-port-inputs-and-outputs",
          "section": "17.3.1"
        }
      ],
      "html_line": 314,
      "anchor": null,
      "section": null,
      "locator": "routing:B028"
    },
    {
      "kind": "h4",
      "text": "17.3.1.1 Track",
      "heading_context": [
        {
          "level": 1,
          "text": "17. Routing and I/O",
          "html_line": 280,
          "anchor": "routing-and-io",
          "section": "17"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "17.3 External MIDI In/Out",
          "html_line": 314,
          "anchor": "external-midi-inout",
          "section": "17.3"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "17.3.1 MIDI Port Inputs and Outputs",
          "html_line": 314,
          "anchor": "midi-port-inputs-and-outputs",
          "section": "17.3.1"
        },
        {
          "level": 4,
          "text": "17.3.1.1 Track",
          "html_line": 326,
          "anchor": "track",
          "section": "17.3.1.1"
        }
      ],
      "html_line": 326,
      "anchor": "track",
      "section": "17.3.1.1",
      "locator": "routing:B029"
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "Enabling Track allows Live to send or receive note and CC (Control Change) messages, for example, when using a MIDI keyboard to play or enter pitches.",
      "heading_context": [
        {
          "level": 1,
          "text": "17. Routing and I/O",
          "html_line": 280,
          "anchor": "routing-and-io",
          "section": "17"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "17.3 External MIDI In/Out",
          "html_line": 314,
          "anchor": "external-midi-inout",
          "section": "17.3"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "17.3.1 MIDI Port Inputs and Outputs",
          "html_line": 314,
          "anchor": "midi-port-inputs-and-outputs",
          "section": "17.3.1"
        },
        {
          "level": 4,
          "text": "17.3.1.1 Track",
          "html_line": 326,
          "anchor": "track",
          "section": "17.3.1.1"
        }
      ],
      "html_line": 326,
      "anchor": null,
      "section": null,
      "locator": "routing:B030"
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "Activate Track for a MIDI port’s input when: - Playing instruments in Live with a MIDI keyboard. - Recording notes into MIDI clips. - Recording MIDI CC messages into MIDI clips, for example to capture parameter changes from an external hardware synthesizer.",
      "heading_context": [
        {
          "level": 1,
          "text": "17. Routing and I/O",
          "html_line": 280,
          "anchor": "routing-and-io",
          "section": "17"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "17.3 External MIDI In/Out",
          "html_line": 314,
          "anchor": "external-midi-inout",
          "section": "17.3"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "17.3.1 MIDI Port Inputs and Outputs",
          "html_line": 314,
          "anchor": "midi-port-inputs-and-outputs",
          "section": "17.3.1"
        },
        {
          "level": 4,
          "text": "17.3.1.1 Track",
          "html_line": 326,
          "anchor": "track",
          "section": "17.3.1.1"
        }
      ],
      "html_line": 326,
      "anchor": null,
      "section": null,
      "locator": "routing:B031"
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "Activate Track for a MIDI port’s output when: - Triggering an external hardware device (like a synthesizer, drum machine, etc). - Sending MIDI notes to another application (using a virtual MIDI bus). - Sending MIDI CC automation to an external device or application.",
      "heading_context": [
        {
          "level": 1,
          "text": "17. Routing and I/O",
          "html_line": 280,
          "anchor": "routing-and-io",
          "section": "17"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "17.3 External MIDI In/Out",
          "html_line": 314,
          "anchor": "external-midi-inout",
          "section": "17.3"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "17.3.1 MIDI Port Inputs and Outputs",
          "html_line": 314,
          "anchor": "midi-port-inputs-and-outputs",
          "section": "17.3.1"
        },
        {
          "level": 4,
          "text": "17.3.1.1 Track",
          "html_line": 326,
          "anchor": "track",
          "section": "17.3.1.1"
        }
      ],
      "html_line": 326,
      "anchor": null,
      "section": null,
      "locator": "routing:B032"
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "Note: You only need to activate Track on the output port for a MIDI controller if it has a built-in sound generator.",
      "heading_context": [
        {
          "level": 1,
          "text": "17. Routing and I/O",
          "html_line": 280,
          "anchor": "routing-and-io",
          "section": "17"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "17.3 External MIDI In/Out",
          "html_line": 314,
          "anchor": "external-midi-inout",
          "section": "17.3"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "17.3.1 MIDI Port Inputs and Outputs",
          "html_line": 314,
          "anchor": "midi-port-inputs-and-outputs",
          "section": "17.3.1"
        },
        {
          "level": 4,
          "text": "17.3.1.1 Track",
          "html_line": 326,
          "anchor": "track",
          "section": "17.3.1.1"
        }
      ],
      "html_line": 326,
      "anchor": null,
      "section": null,
      "locator": "routing:B033"
    },
    {
      "kind": "h4",
      "text": "17.3.1.2 Sync",
      "heading_context": [
        {
          "level": 1,
          "text": "17. Routing and I/O",
          "html_line": 280,
          "anchor": "routing-and-io",
          "section": "17"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "17.3 External MIDI In/Out",
          "html_line": 314,
          "anchor": "external-midi-inout",
          "section": "17.3"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "17.3.1 MIDI Port Inputs and Outputs",
          "html_line": 314,
          "anchor": "midi-port-inputs-and-outputs",
          "section": "17.3.1"
        },
        {
          "level": 4,
          "text": "17.3.1.2 Sync",
          "html_line": 326,
          "anchor": "sync",
          "section": "17.3.1.2"
        }
      ],
      "html_line": 326,
      "anchor": "sync",
      "section": "17.3.1.2",
      "locator": "routing:B034"
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "Sync allows Live to send or receive MIDI Clock, or receive MIDI Timecode. Note: Unless it has a built-in sequencer or arpeggiator, you won’t ever need to activate Sync on the input or output ports of a MIDI controller.",
      "heading_context": [
        {
          "level": 1,
          "text": "17. Routing and I/O",
          "html_line": 280,
          "anchor": "routing-and-io",
          "section": "17"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "17.3 External MIDI In/Out",
          "html_line": 314,
          "anchor": "external-midi-inout",
          "section": "17.3"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "17.3.1 MIDI Port Inputs and Outputs",
          "html_line": 314,
          "anchor": "midi-port-inputs-and-outputs",
          "section": "17.3.1"
        },
        {
          "level": 4,
          "text": "17.3.1.2 Sync",
          "html_line": 326,
          "anchor": "sync",
          "section": "17.3.1.2"
        }
      ],
      "html_line": 326,
      "anchor": null,
      "section": null,
      "locator": "routing:B035"
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "Activate Sync for a MIDI port’s input when: - Synchronizing Live to an external sequencer, drum machine or groove box. - Synchronizing Live to another DAW using MIDI.",
      "heading_context": [
        {
          "level": 1,
          "text": "17. Routing and I/O",
          "html_line": 280,
          "anchor": "routing-and-io",
          "section": "17"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "17.3 External MIDI In/Out",
          "html_line": 314,
          "anchor": "external-midi-inout",
          "section": "17.3"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "17.3.1 MIDI Port Inputs and Outputs",
          "html_line": 314,
          "anchor": "midi-port-inputs-and-outputs",
          "section": "17.3.1"
        },
        {
          "level": 4,
          "text": "17.3.1.2 Sync",
          "html_line": 326,
          "anchor": "sync",
          "section": "17.3.1.2"
        }
      ],
      "html_line": 326,
      "anchor": null,
      "section": null,
      "locator": "routing:B036"
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "Activate Sync for a MIDI port’s output when: - Synchronizing an external sequencer, drum machine or groove box to Live using MIDI Clock. - Synchronizing another DAW to Live using MIDI Clock. - Synchronizing the LFO and arpeggiator of an external synthesizer or MIDI controller to Live.",
      "heading_context": [
        {
          "level": 1,
          "text": "17. Routing and I/O",
          "html_line": 280,
          "anchor": "routing-and-io",
          "section": "17"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "17.3 External MIDI In/Out",
          "html_line": 314,
          "anchor": "external-midi-inout",
          "section": "17.3"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "17.3.1 MIDI Port Inputs and Outputs",
          "html_line": 314,
          "anchor": "midi-port-inputs-and-outputs",
          "section": "17.3.1"
        },
        {
          "level": 4,
          "text": "17.3.1.2 Sync",
          "html_line": 326,
          "anchor": "sync",
          "section": "17.3.1.2"
        }
      ],
      "html_line": 326,
      "anchor": null,
      "section": null,
      "locator": "routing:B037"
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "When Sync is enabled for a port’s output, you can access a set of additional options by pressing the triangle next to the port’s name.",
      "heading_context": [
        {
          "level": 1,
          "text": "17. Routing and I/O",
          "html_line": 280,
          "anchor": "routing-and-io",
          "section": "17"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "17.3 External MIDI In/Out",
          "html_line": 314,
          "anchor": "external-midi-inout",
          "section": "17.3"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "17.3.1 MIDI Port Inputs and Outputs",
          "html_line": 314,
          "anchor": "midi-port-inputs-and-outputs",
          "section": "17.3.1"
        },
        {
          "level": 4,
          "text": "17.3.1.2 Sync",
          "html_line": 326,
          "anchor": "sync",
          "section": "17.3.1.2"
        }
      ],
      "html_line": 326,
      "anchor": null,
      "section": null,
      "locator": "routing:B038"
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "You can adjust the MIDI Clock Sync Delay amount to add a delay to outgoing MIDI sync signals in milliseconds. This can help correct any timing issues that occur between Live and the external hardware.",
      "heading_context": [
        {
          "level": 1,
          "text": "17. Routing and I/O",
          "html_line": 280,
          "anchor": "routing-and-io",
          "section": "17"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "17.3 External MIDI In/Out",
          "html_line": 314,
          "anchor": "external-midi-inout",
          "section": "17.3"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "17.3.1 MIDI Port Inputs and Outputs",
          "html_line": 314,
          "anchor": "midi-port-inputs-and-outputs",
          "section": "17.3.1"
        },
        {
          "level": 4,
          "text": "17.3.1.2 Sync",
          "html_line": 326,
          "anchor": "sync",
          "section": "17.3.1.2"
        }
      ],
      "html_line": 338,
      "anchor": null,
      "section": null,
      "locator": "routing:B039"
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "MIDI Clock Type can be set to either Song to Pattern. In Song Mode, Live will send out MIDI Song Position Pointer (SPP) and Continue messages each time the play position changes. In Pattern Mode, Live will only use Start messages, sent out at the start of the following bar. Use Pattern Mode if your MIDI device does not recognize SPP messages.",
      "heading_context": [
        {
          "level": 1,
          "text": "17. Routing and I/O",
          "html_line": 280,
          "anchor": "routing-and-io",
          "section": "17"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "17.3 External MIDI In/Out",
          "html_line": 314,
          "anchor": "external-midi-inout",
          "section": "17.3"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "17.3.1 MIDI Port Inputs and Outputs",
          "html_line": 314,
          "anchor": "midi-port-inputs-and-outputs",
          "section": "17.3.1"
        },
        {
          "level": 4,
          "text": "17.3.1.2 Sync",
          "html_line": 326,
          "anchor": "sync",
          "section": "17.3.1.2"
        }
      ],
      "html_line": 338,
      "anchor": null,
      "section": null,
      "locator": "routing:B040"
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "The Hardware Resync drop-down lets you choose how a resync message is sent when the Resync External Hardware option is enabled.",
      "heading_context": [
        {
          "level": 1,
          "text": "17. Routing and I/O",
          "html_line": 280,
          "anchor": "routing-and-io",
          "section": "17"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "17.3 External MIDI In/Out",
          "html_line": 314,
          "anchor": "external-midi-inout",
          "section": "17.3"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "17.3.1 MIDI Port Inputs and Outputs",
          "html_line": 314,
          "anchor": "midi-port-inputs-and-outputs",
          "section": "17.3.1"
        },
        {
          "level": 4,
          "text": "17.3.1.2 Sync",
          "html_line": 326,
          "anchor": "sync",
          "section": "17.3.1.2"
        }
      ],
      "html_line": 338,
      "anchor": null,
      "section": null,
      "locator": "routing:B041"
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "When enabled, the Resync External Hardware button appears in Live’s Control bar, and can be used to send resync messages out to external gear. This is useful when synced hardware drifts out of time with the Live Set during playback.",
      "heading_context": [
        {
          "level": 1,
          "text": "17. Routing and I/O",
          "html_line": 280,
          "anchor": "routing-and-io",
          "section": "17"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "17.3 External MIDI In/Out",
          "html_line": 314,
          "anchor": "external-midi-inout",
          "section": "17.3"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "17.3.1 MIDI Port Inputs and Outputs",
          "html_line": 314,
          "anchor": "midi-port-inputs-and-outputs",
          "section": "17.3.1"
        },
        {
          "level": 4,
          "text": "17.3.1.2 Sync",
          "html_line": 326,
          "anchor": "sync",
          "section": "17.3.1.2"
        }
      ],
      "html_line": 354,
      "anchor": null,
      "section": null,
      "locator": "routing:B042"
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "The default behavior is Stop and Start, which sends a resync message consisting of a MIDI Clock Stop event followed by a MIDI Clock Start event; this works best with most MIDI devices. If set to Start Only, just the MIDI Clock Start event resync message is sent; this might work better for some devices. If set to Don’t Resync, no resync messages are sent.",
      "heading_context": [
        {
          "level": 1,
          "text": "17. Routing and I/O",
          "html_line": 280,
          "anchor": "routing-and-io",
          "section": "17"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "17.3 External MIDI In/Out",
          "html_line": 314,
          "anchor": "external-midi-inout",
          "section": "17.3"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "17.3.1 MIDI Port Inputs and Outputs",
          "html_line": 314,
          "anchor": "midi-port-inputs-and-outputs",
          "section": "17.3.1"
        },
        {
          "level": 4,
          "text": "17.3.1.2 Sync",
          "html_line": 326,
          "anchor": "sync",
          "section": "17.3.1.2"
        }
      ],
      "html_line": 366,
      "anchor": null,
      "section": null,
      "locator": "routing:B043"
    },
    {
      "kind": "h4",
      "text": "17.3.1.3 Remote",
      "heading_context": [
        {
          "level": 1,
          "text": "17. Routing and I/O",
          "html_line": 280,
          "anchor": "routing-and-io",
          "section": "17"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "17.3 External MIDI In/Out",
          "html_line": 314,
          "anchor": "external-midi-inout",
          "section": "17.3"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "17.3.1 MIDI Port Inputs and Outputs",
          "html_line": 314,
          "anchor": "midi-port-inputs-and-outputs",
          "section": "17.3.1"
        },
        {
          "level": 4,
          "text": "17.3.1.3 Remote",
          "html_line": 366,
          "anchor": "remote",
          "section": "17.3.1.3"
        }
      ],
      "html_line": 366,
      "anchor": "remote",
      "section": "17.3.1.3",
      "locator": "routing:B044"
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "The Remote switch allows you to create mappings from a MIDI controller to parameters in Live or to send feedback to a MIDI controller.",
      "heading_context": [
        {
          "level": 1,
          "text": "17. Routing and I/O",
          "html_line": 280,
          "anchor": "routing-and-io",
          "section": "17"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "17.3 External MIDI In/Out",
          "html_line": 314,
          "anchor": "external-midi-inout",
          "section": "17.3"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "17.3.1 MIDI Port Inputs and Outputs",
          "html_line": 314,
          "anchor": "midi-port-inputs-and-outputs",
          "section": "17.3.1"
        },
        {
          "level": 4,
          "text": "17.3.1.3 Remote",
          "html_line": 366,
          "anchor": "remote",
          "section": "17.3.1.3"
        }
      ],
      "html_line": 366,
      "anchor": null,
      "section": null,
      "locator": "routing:B045"
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "Activate Remote for a MIDI port’s input when: - Creating custom MIDI mappings to be able to control parameters in Live. - Using a MIDI keyboard to trigger MIDI Clips.",
      "heading_context": [
        {
          "level": 1,
          "text": "17. Routing and I/O",
          "html_line": 280,
          "anchor": "routing-and-io",
          "section": "17"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "17.3 External MIDI In/Out",
          "html_line": 314,
          "anchor": "external-midi-inout",
          "section": "17.3"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "17.3.1 MIDI Port Inputs and Outputs",
          "html_line": 314,
          "anchor": "midi-port-inputs-and-outputs",
          "section": "17.3.1"
        },
        {
          "level": 4,
          "text": "17.3.1.3 Remote",
          "html_line": 366,
          "anchor": "remote",
          "section": "17.3.1.3"
        }
      ],
      "html_line": 366,
      "anchor": null,
      "section": null,
      "locator": "routing:B046"
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "Activate Remote for a MIDI port’s output when: - Using MIDI controllers with LEDs that reflect the status of mapped Live parameters. - Using MIDI controllers with motorized faders that reflect the status of mapped Live parameters.",
      "heading_context": [
        {
          "level": 1,
          "text": "17. Routing and I/O",
          "html_line": 280,
          "anchor": "routing-and-io",
          "section": "17"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "17.3 External MIDI In/Out",
          "html_line": 314,
          "anchor": "external-midi-inout",
          "section": "17.3"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "17.3.1 MIDI Port Inputs and Outputs",
          "html_line": 314,
          "anchor": "midi-port-inputs-and-outputs",
